---
Fix audition sample slot corruption.

The audition feature overwrites a sample slot that may be in use by
a track, corrupting the track's sample data. Use a dedicated audition
slot separate from the track sample array.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Audition uses a dedicated sample slot (not shared with tracks)
- [ ] Track sample data is never overwritten by audition
- [ ] Audition playback stops cleanly when a new audition starts
- [ ] No corruption after multiple audition+track interactions

## Test Plan
- [ ] Load project with samples, audition a different sample, verify track samples unchanged
- [ ] Audition while track is playing, verify track audio unaffected
- [ ] Rapid audition switching, verify no corruption
